["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Disagree With Your Kids Without Fighting HEAR framework curiosity sandwich false polarization hedging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-raisinggh-别只让孩子换位思考-要让他看见你在听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41f3114355314dc3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">55:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>別教孩子共情，先讓他看見你在聽</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">讓孩子學會好好分歧，關鍵不是教共情或換位思考，而是用語言證明你在聽；HEAR 框架和好奇三明治可以立刻用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">分歧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What does a parent owe their child? PGT-A polygenic testing pleiotropy satisficing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-grayarea-胚胎筛选-父母该为孩子做到哪一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b28234367aefc8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>篩選胚胎不是盡一切可能，是道德綁架</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基因篩選能降低疾病風險，但統計意義常被誇大，且可能加劇社會不平等。父母應追求「足夠好」而非「最優」，警惕商業公司的道德綁架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基因篩選</span><span class=\"tag\">生育倫理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Weight of Fame: A Hollywood Tragedy lipectomy fen-phen primary pulmonary hypertension (PPH)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-07-cautionary-制片厂的合同里写着-女演员的身体不得改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>女演員合同鎖死體重：增重即違約，減肥即送命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1920 年代女演員 Molly 因體重增加被片方雪藏、走上手術檯；1990 年代新娘 Mary 因減肥藥芬芬喪命。當身體成為商業資產，懲罰與捷徑都通向同一個結局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好萊塢</span><span class=\"tag\">身體標準</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why did AMD just buy this REALLY WEIRD chip company? SRAM reticle size agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-techtechpotato-amd收购talus-押注模型定制芯片的未来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0d473494a95916b2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AMD收購Talus：把AI模型燒進芯片，每秒跑1.7萬token</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AMD收購了Talus，一家為特定AI模型定製芯片、實現每秒17,000 tokens的初創公司。這標誌著AI推理走向非可編程、模型專用芯片的方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">AMD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How “Forgive and Forget” Buried a Church’s Dark Secret OALC mandated reporter forgive and forget\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-papertrail-教会用-原谅与遗忘-处理性侵-受害者被要求闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/031f7ffec8b5b0e0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">45:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>教會用「原諒與遺忘」處理性侵，受害者被要求閉嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明尼蘇達州一個封閉教派把「原諒與遺忘」寫進官方指引，讓性侵在內部消化、不進司法程序。一名檢察官把案子交給記者，才挖出跨三代的系統性掩蓋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教機構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The FCC&#x27;s New Robot Rules covered list conditional approval blue UAS list bad labs onshoring plan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-chinatalk-fcc-用一份笨规则-把中国机器人挡在门外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a805ef1f2e186f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>FCC 用一份笨規則，把中國機器人擋在門外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">FCC 把移動機器人列入 covered list，新機型一律不能進口。理由不是技術多先進，而是供應鏈依賴越晚解決越難，所以寧可要簡單粗暴的規則，也不要精雕細琢的豁免。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"賈揚清：我所經歷的「人工智能已死」到「AI 顛覆世界」的數年鉅變丨串臺「聲東擊西」S10E24 Caffe AlexNet Agent FAIR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-whatsnext-单个智能体再强也成不了团队-ai需要生产关系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>AI沒殺死工作，Agent團隊才是真瓶頸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">賈揚清從Caffe到兩次創業，復盤AI十五年：模型能力已經夠用，瓶頸在怎麼讓一群Agent像人類團隊一樣協作，他還斷言AI沒帶來大規模裁員，只是替罪羊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chasing Trillion-Dollar Companies, Founder Ambition, Token Budgets, and Regulatory Capture with Sarah &amp; Elad punctuated equilibrium RSI ROIT regulatory capture exit tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-nopriors-三位万亿公司五年内出现-但下一个不会这么快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d8446c4650e10d7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">39:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>三位萬億公司五年內出現，但下一個不會這麼快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年內三家從零到萬億美元市值是歷史異常，不是新常態。真正稀缺的不是大市場，而是能在五年內跑到 500 億美元收入的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人退出</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Barry Ritholtz: How Not to Invest | Rational Reminder 421 halo effect Gell-Mann amnesia Sturgeon&#x27;s Law decumulation ESOP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-rationalreminder-亿万富翁的经济预测-和短视频里的理财建议一样不可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d88279cd5f22a944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>億萬富翁的經濟預測，和短視頻裡的理財建議一樣不可信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光環效應讓人把成功者的所有話當洞見，但他們在自己領域之外同樣一無所知；好建議謙卑且概率化，壞建議自信且具體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投資</span><span class=\"tag\">行為金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Weight Loss: Why Won&#x27;t It Stick? weight cycling visceral fat macrophage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-sciencevs-体重循环不毁代谢-健康行为比体重重要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>溜溜球節食不毀代謝，健康習慣比體重更決定壽命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">體重循環（溜溜球節食）不會永久破壞代謝，普通人的反彈增重很少造成肌肉流失；真正影響健康和壽命的是健康習慣本身，不是體重的上下波動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體重循環</span><span class=\"tag\">減肥</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Brad Setser on the US&#x27;s Unusual Japanese Yen Intervention FIMA Repo Facility ESF Primary Balance Carry Trade Big Mac Index\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-oddlots-美国为何联手日本干预日元-新工具与旧逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>美國聯手日本干預日元：賣歐元而非美元，賭日本央行加息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國財政部罕見聯手日本干預日元，賣出歐元而非美元，並動用 FEMA 回購工具。Brad Setser 認為，只要日本央行加息，干預就能奏效，且日本財政狀況遠好於美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日元</span><span class=\"tag\">外匯干預</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The economics of putting germicidal light in every room, with Misha Gurevich and Vivian Belenky of Aerolamp far UVC krypton chloride excimer lamp ASHRAE 241 R0 hygiene hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-06-complexsys-222纳米杀菌灯便宜有效-缺的是认知而非技术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fc764da6acb74e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0806</span></div>\n<h2>222納米燈殺菌有效卻一年只賣幾百臺，瓶頸不是技術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Far UVC 用 222 納米光在空氣中滅活病原體，對人體表層無害；南非 TB 試驗已看到 90% 抑制，但全世界一年只賣幾百臺。真正瓶頸是認知擴散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">far UVC</span><span class=\"tag\">空氣傳播疾病</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Julia Ioffe on Russian Women, Missing Men, and the Roots of Autocracy woman question single sex family gender essentialism pronatalist policy steam valve\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-tyler-苏联把女人炼成超人-把男人宠成废物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3096d9c0d3a4a23d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">55:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>蘇聯把女人煉成超人，把男人寵成廢物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二戰後2700萬蘇聯人喪生，男人成了稀缺資源；國家用墮胎禁令、婚外生育獎勵和家暴非刑化把女人鍛成超人，把男人寵成廢物，這套秩序至今支撐普京的父權動員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄國社會</span><span class=\"tag\">性別政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E247｜對話盛穎：xAI，Infra的浪漫，SGLang，開源，平權與“甄嬛傳” SGLang RadixAttention KVCache Miles day zero one year cliff\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-05-sv101-xai-最美好的时代-为什么留不住她/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0805</span></div>\n<h2>xAI 最美好的時代，為什麼留不住她</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盛穎把 xAI 早期稱為 v1.0：不到 100 人、沒有 politics、同時給她 support 和 freedom。她為了 SGLang 社區提前兩個月離開，放棄一年 cliff 的 vesting。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"美國無人駕駛20年興衰：天才、小偷、叛徒，從沙漠到法庭的大冒險 DARPA L3 激光雷達 founder mode\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-cnf65bb3-自动驾驶真正的难关不是技术-是最后那-5-的意外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac2c4de6938cb713-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技這碗飯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>自動駕駛真正的難關不是技術，是最後那 5% 的意外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995 年一輛奔馳就自動跑完了 1758 公里高速，95% 的里程機器早就會開；可只要剩下 5% 的意外還在，駕駛座上就必須留一個人，司機的工資一分錢都省不下來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">DARPA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Big Tech&#x27;s Hidden Debt Problem off-balance-sheet vehicle vendor financing big market delusion incomplete revelation hypothesis limits of arbitrage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-patrickboyle-表外债务不是欺诈-真正的风险是没人读脚注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨頭表外債務不是欺詐，是沒人讀腳註</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 1.65 萬億美元隱藏債務並不是 Enron 式欺詐，而是未投運數據中心的長租與採購承諾，合法但埋在腳註裡；真正危險的是 AI 巨頭靠互相融資和調整後收益講故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 資本開支</span><span class=\"tag\">表外債務</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the hell happened with AGI timelines in 2026? – Rob Wiblin RLVR METR ECI GDPval Vending-Bench 2 AI Village\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-eightythousand-agi-时间线提前一年-但脏活仍是瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a7038cb60f3d75b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">49:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>AI 收入年增 700%，但髒活任務仍差人類 6 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年 AI 進展證據：收入爆炸、編碼智能體成熟，但髒活任務仍差；時間線縮短約一年，但長期仍存變數。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"283: ENCORE: Best of Ask Lisa: Friendship Breakups &amp; Conflict relational aggression queen bee blame the parent two-faced\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-asklisa-友谊破裂是成长章节-不是人生判决/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">23:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>被朋友群踢出不是判決：那是化學鍵在加固</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子被朋友群排擠，或要主動結束一段友誼，都是青春期的正常章節；家長最該做的是給孩子視角和具體話術，而不是代替他衝進去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">友誼</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"178: Ubiquiti least privilege VPN kill switch MAC address\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-04-darknetdiaries-ubiquiti-内鬼自导自演勒索比特币-败在自家路由器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e2627fbdeaef9327-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Darknet Diaries</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0804</span></div>\n<h2>年薪 25 萬美元仍嫌少，他自導自演勒索自家公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ubiquiti 雲團隊負責人覺得年薪 25 萬美元還不夠，自導自演入侵公司、索要 25 比特幣，結果被自家路由器記錄的 MAC 地址鎖定，判刑六年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內鬼攻擊</span><span class=\"tag\">企業勒索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Inference Engineering Masterclass — Philip Kiely &amp; Ali Taha, Baseten speculative decoding (spec dec) PD disaggregation NVFP4 mega kernel expert parallelism KV cache compaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-latentspace-量化更多层反而更准-因为误差会互相抵消/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23103bc773bd5837-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>量化更多層反而更準：誤差會互相抵消</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">選對層之後，量化更多反而更保真——誤差會互相抵消；同理 10 倍加速不是單點突破，而是量化、speculator、PD 分離各翻一倍疊出來的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理優化</span><span class=\"tag\">量化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Political Economy of Palestine (with Hussein Aboubakr Mansour) autopoietic symbolic convertibility machine UNRWA teshuvah\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-econtalk-巴勒斯坦不是民族事业-而是自再生的政治经济榨取机器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>巴勒斯坦不是民族事業，是臺自再生的符號榨取機器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別再把巴勒斯坦當作單一民族事業——在中東權力結構裡，它是一臺把苦難轉成各方資產的符號機器：沒有中心、沒有可殺的國王，只能通過個人意義上的清醒破局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東政治</span><span class=\"tag\">尋租經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Tungsten Market Is Warning of an Upcoming War Ammonium Paratungstate (APT) Dry Metric Ton Unit (DMTU) Tungsten Carbide Ionic Absorption Clays\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-oddlots-钨价暴涨背后-一场百年战争预测市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>鎢價暴漲是百年戰爭預測市場：中國斷供即翻十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鎢的供需週期像戰爭預測市場：戰前暴漲、戰後崩盤。中國控制八成供應，西方重啟舊礦僅需數千萬美元，卻因缺乏期貨市場而難以融資。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">鎢</span><span class=\"tag\">關鍵礦產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Re-release: Raising an Entrepreneur (Without Taking Over Their Business) Roth IRA unschooling sliding scale pricing guide on the side intake form\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-03-parentmojo-给孩子最大的财务礼物不是大学基金-是让她10岁创业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0803</span></div>\n<h2>給孩子最大的財務禮物不是大學基金，是讓她10歲創業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">10歲孩子靠寵物託管賺到759美元退休金，這不是提前雞娃，而是用真實責任練出系統思維、邊界感、堅持和財務自由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童創業</span><span class=\"tag\">財務啟蒙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"50 - Eli Lifland on AI 2027 research taste uplift time horizon research stock indexical sandbag\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-02-axrp-ai-2027-作者-对齐下一代-ai-ai-比人省一千倍力气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/912f9695220a1820-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:40:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0802</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2027 作者：對齊下一代 AI，AI 比人省一千倍力氣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 2027 里人類對齊超級智能千難萬險，agent 4 對齊下一代卻幾乎一次成功——Eli 承認這個不對稱是真的，AI 自己動手至少省一千倍認知量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">智能爆炸</span>\n</div></div></a>"]